cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "VanToVault Duplex Buyers Atlas: Owner-Occupant 2-4 Unit Purchase Loans by Metro, 2018-2025"
version: "1.0.1"
date-released: "2026-09-27"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23003737"
url: "https://vantovault.com/library/duplex-buyers-atlas/"
repository: "https://github.com/vantovault-stack/open-housing-data"
license: CC-BY-4.0
authors:
  - name: Van to Vault
    website: "https://vantovault.com"
    email: stephan@vantovault.com
abstract: >-
  Owner-occupant purchase mortgages on 2-, 3- and 4-unit homes in the United States,
  2018-2025, by year and by metropolitan statistical area or metropolitan division,
  counted from the public HMDA loan-level data (FFIEC/CFPB). Cells of 1-9 loans are
  suppressed; metro-years with fewer than 50 loans are reported as three-year totals.
keywords:
  - HMDA
  - mortgage
  - duplex
  - small multifamily
  - owner-occupant
  - housing
references:
  - type: data
    title: "Home Mortgage Disclosure Act (HMDA) public loan-level data, 2018-2025"
    authors:
      - name: "Federal Financial Institutions Examination Council"
      - name: "Consumer Financial Protection Bureau"
    url: "https://ffiec.cfpb.gov/data-browser/"
